    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 02 Name of Land: Diellawaththa; Description : Estate; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: Lalan Plantation Limited; Extent: 0.3880 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      302.47,
      456.32,
      541.73,
      573.33
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid Land/Lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are here by required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at Thumpane Divisional Secretariat, on the 10th of July 2024 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 05th of July 2024, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation the details of the computation of such amount.",
